cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "EnvelopeMetrics"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code for quantifying the rhythm of speech via its amplitude envelope:
  Low Frequency Fourier Analysis (LFFA) of the envelope's power spectrum, and
  Empirical Mode Decomposition (EMD) / Hilbert-Huang analysis of its intrinsic
  oscillatory components.
authors:
  - family-names: "Tilsen"
    given-names: "Sam"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tilsen/EnvelopeMetrics"
type: software
